"B<#include E<lt>sys/types.hE<gt>>\n"
"B<#include E<lt>netinet/in.hE<gt>>\n"
msgstr ""
"B<#include E<lt>sys/types.hE<gt>>\n"
"B<#include E<lt>netinet/in.hE<gt>>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
